---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import { site } from '../lib/site';
---
<Page title="How we use AI" description="What is AI-made, how we disclose it, who owns what, and what we won't do." eyebrow="Disclosure" heading="Everything here is made with AI. Here's how.">
  <div class="wrap prose ai">
    <h2>What's AI-made</h2>
    <p>Every frame and film on this site is generated with AI image and video models, then directed, edited, graded and sound-designed by a human. {site.mascot} and {site.producer}, our hosts, are AI characters with AI voices. The brands in our spec films (SOL, VESPER, AURUM) are invented.</p>
    {/* TODO(founder): list the exact tools and plans in use once their commercial and data terms are confirmed. */}
    <h2>How we disclose it</h2>
    <p>Every film tile carries a label like "Spec film · invented brand · 100% AI · 30 s · 9 shots". Client deliverables come with a list of every generated element, so you can disclose correctly. Platforms such as Meta and TikTok may add their own AI label to ads.</p>
    <h2>Your photos</h2>
    <p>We use the product photos you send only to make your frames and film. We don't post them or share them outside the studio. Uploaded photos are deleted after 90 days unless we're working together.</p>
    <h2>Rights</h2>
    <p>On full payment you get a perpetual, worldwide licence for your digital ads, organic posts and site. Purely AI-generated material may not be copyrightable in the US, so exclusivity is our promise, not a legal guarantee.</p>
    <h2>What we won't do</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Realistic AI people pretending to be customers, or fake reviews and testimonials.</li>
      <li>A real person's face or voice without written consent.</li>
      <li>Health or results claims you can't back up.</li>
      <li>Present AI footage as filmed.</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/frames">Get my 5 free frames</a></div>
  </div>
</Page>
<style>.ai { padding-bottom: 96px; }</style>
